@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title D01 - Two projects and three existing owners
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

package "Project A - DTAL optimization" {
  [World DTAL builder / cache] as Builder
  [Group GPU data and current parameters\ninside existing LightManager] as Manager
  [Member / point sampler] as MemberSampler
}

package "Shared small source interface" {
  [UID, bounds, reach, coverage, power] as Domain
  [Current parent index, p_source, statistics slot] as Selection
}

package "Project B - cluster improvement" {
  [Existing ClusterLightLists\ncandidates, fast / tail, source selector] as Clusters
}

[Ordinary / dynamic source producers] as Ordinary
[Direct and indirect shading] as Shading
[Existing frame slots and RHI lifetime] as Frame

Builder --> Manager : validated groups / patches / member aliases
Builder --> Domain : group source domain
Ordinary --> Domain : ordinary source domain
Domain --> Clusters : opaque parent metadata
Clusters --> Manager : CPU tables reference UIDs
Manager --> Selection : current-index publication
Selection --> MemberSampler : selected parent and source probability
Manager --> MemberSampler : real geometry and current emission
MemberSampler --> Shading : sample, dw and p_member
Frame ..> Manager : existing copies, descriptors and retirement
Frame ..> Shading : compatible resources for the frame

note bottom of Builder
  Build only on relevant regeneration.
  No representative energy transfer.
end note
note right of Clusters
  B also works with ordinary sources alone.
  A initially uses the existing cluster policy
  through its minimal group-domain adapter.
end note
@enduml
